{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20905","headline":"黄家洞 · 李贺","name":"黄家洞","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"雀步蹙沙声促促，四尺角弓青石镞。\n黑幡三点铜鼓鸣，高作猨啼摇箭箙。\n彩巾缠踍幅半斜，溪头簇队暎葛花。\n山潭晚雾吟白鼍，竹蛇飞蠹射金沙。\n闲驱竹马缓归家，官军自杀容州槎。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李贺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20905.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20905","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}